      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先不管这究竟是不是神谕，\n小栗帽确实帮助了他人，让人露出笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aebc753d529b0386abc91ef6f902a9e470bc77e3d507d6cdba1cf09b038cee4",
