      "uid": "zhcn:de94b9fdd499e6ab54dec9ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽坦率真诚的亲切态度，\n为她赢得一位新的粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbfe86067f38cfd534b7c9b061c0f1e9ee54c12760899d80c3c34922e061f94e",
