      "uid": "zhcn:d30b3dc290b2e063acdd7ae0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且我是在山脚下长大的，\n这座山对我来说就像家里的院子一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e400c6e4d0957c9be18ce6d91391505f2ede833d81b40cca58de78ba8c99d67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
